     A*
     A* V-Pay History File
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 08/27/2020 by c:62 for Project WC2749
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will hold the document id, date and time
     A*          uploaded and record counts.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PVH01                     TEXT('V-Pay History File')
     A            VHDOCNAME     30A         COLHDG('V-Pay Document Name')
     A            VHEXTDATE R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Extract Date')
     A            VHEXTTIME R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Extract Time')
     A            VHHD001CNTR     S         REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Header Record Count')
     A            VHVR001CNTR     S         REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Payment Record Count')
     A            VHVR002CNTR     S         REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Payee Record Count')
     A            VHVR003CNTR     S         REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Claim Record Count')
     A            VHTR999CNTR     S         REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Trailer Record Count')
     A            VHTOTALCNTR     S         REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Total Record Count')
     A*
     A            VHSTAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            VHUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint User')
     A            VHPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Program')
     A            VHTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Time')
     A            VHDT      R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Date')
